# Never upload local secrets or state as build context.
#
# `gcloud builds submit` tars this directory and uploads it before building, so without
# this file the master token in `.env` would leave the machine and land in the build
# service. `.gitignore` does not cover this - it is a different mechanism.
.env
.venv/
state.json
before-write.json
*.snapshot.json
gate2-log.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc
